  "description": {
   "value": "<p><strong>Cost:</strong> 1,500eb (Very Expensive)<br><strong>Enhances:</strong> Berserk<br><strong>Option Slots:</strong> 0 (Cyberware Enhancement)</p>\n<p>Berserk Operating System. Berserk runs 15 seconds (5 Rounds) instead of its usual duration, and a non-FBC user with no Cyberspine shoots at -4 on every Ranged Attack while it burns. While it is up, each of these costs only half of a ROF 2 Action: Grab, Human Shield, Get Up, Equip or Drop Shield, and stowing a weapon, clearing a jam, putting yourself out while On Fire, activating an item or a piece of cyberware. Once each Round, a Brawling, Martial Arts, or Melee Weapon hit that gets 4 or more damage past armor and damage reduction also counts twice toward Martial Arts Special Move requirements.</p>\n<p><strong>Foundry notes:</strong></p><ul><li>Every Operating System is incompatible with every other Operating System and with the base cyberware it is for: none of them can be installed while another OS, or that OS's own base cyberware, is anywhere in the user's body or in a worn apparatus they're connected to. The sheet doesn't enforce that.</li></ul>\n<p><em>From <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/13EnSAoiLDsC7zmL-Jr1RqIh_EnuVuFnExqiipDVquMk/edit\">Corgo's 77 Collection V3</a> by Corgopolis (Operating Systems &gt; Berserk Operating Systems).</em></p>"
